# Miss Queen (MissQueen): a level 20 human fighter, of a starting class with no PK, asks for the
# trainee's coupon and gets it, the coupon's player memo set; asked again, and after a relog,
# it is told it has it. The traveler's coupon is refused to a starting class. Expectations are
# the reference trace's (MissQueen.onAdvEvent).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/miss_queen_trainee.golden
character Trainee 20
script script.feature.MissQueen
item 7832 7833
page default/31760.htm
page script/feature/MissQueen/
npc queen 31760 Folk 10 0 0

